{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Momenta is an endless arcade game in which you will unlock new powers as you drive deeper into space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712590/extras/logo_stroke_gradient_1280.png?t=1746717131\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Orbs, gain Momentum, and Charge your star power to unlock new abilities. Speed through space, magnetize collectables, and go for the high score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist art and music will relax you into a Tetris like trance as you chase the leaderboards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect more stars to unlock new abilities or more speed multipliers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo includes the simple run, but doesn't include missions or unlocks that will push your runs to the deepest reaches of space. When you unlock the full game you can upgrade your runs and complete missions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your star into a shooting star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712590/extras/steam_4_framed.png?t=1746717131\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712590?t=1746717131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712590/a45d8989235c14f01dd554a8886df7c7629f8f2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746717131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712590/fe401c2da0c7d581a92bc9f06bab4b223fecd15f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746717131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712590/fe401c2da0c7d581a92bc9f06bab4b223fecd15f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746717131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Momenta is an endless arcade game in which you will unlock new powers as you drive deeper into space.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712590/extras/logo_stroke_gradient_1280.png?t=1746717131\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Orbs, gain Momentum, and Charge your star power to unlock new abilities. Speed through space, magnetize collectables, and go for the high score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist art and music will relax you into a Tetris like trance as you chase the leaderboards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect more stars to unlock new abilities or more speed multipliers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo includes the simple run, but doesn't include missions or unlocks that will push your runs to the deepest reaches of space. When you unlock the full game you can upgrade your runs and complete missions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your star into a shooting star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712590/extras/steam_4_framed.png?t=1746717131\" /></p>","developers":["Cyclogon"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3624800","name":"Momenta"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712590/7b4aa5c4120b68b82567c477a662724483dfc62b/header.jpg?t=1746717131","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirement